This is the same situation as in an IRT model.

The easiest thing to do is center either A or B, e.g.,

  A ~ normal(0,sigma_A);
  B ~ normal(mu_B, sigma_B);

Alternatively, you could fix one of the components of A
or B and then everything will be defined relative to that.

- Bob

