No real way to do it elegantly. The best I can offer is:

  parameters {
    vector[K-1] B_raw;

  transformed parameters {
    vector[K] B;
    B[1] <- 0;
    for (k in 2:K)
      B[k] <- B_raw[k-1];

The loop will be replaceable with

  B[2:K] <- B_raw;

when I finish the slicing feature I'm working on, but for now
(Stan 2.5), the loop's the only option.

- Bob

