Subject: Re: [stan-users] Efficient parameterization of a mixture of a truncated & unconstrained negative binomial distribut.
Message-ID: <gqIbjwsGHw4.wsiIq7ODmIIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <gqIbjwsGHw4.e3cnYfDrVmwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
