Subject: Re: [stan-users] Adding parameter constraints in order to avoid label switching problem
Message-ID: <fCf0PIFsvFs.JRgUJ9mCw3wJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <fCf0PIFsvFs.bFMUO3khMJoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <fCf0PIFsvFs.bFMUO3khMJoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
