On Friday, November 21, 2014 12:32:03 PM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:
> Rasmus,
>
> Can you pass the -ffast-math flag to LLVM via emscripten? That disables exceptions but last time I checked allowed Stan to sort of work when compiled with clang++ (although not with g++).

Upon further review, don't do that. Instead pass to emcc

-s DISABLE_EXCEPTION_CATCHING=0

See

https://kripken.github.io/emscripten-site/docs/optimizing/Optimizing-Code.html#optimizing-code-exception-catching

Ben

